Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:42:01 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Require a confirmation code to remove an Event

GET /admin/events/{id}/delete shows a confirmation page with a 4-digit code generated by Lib\ConfirmationCode and kept in the session per Event. DELETE /admin/events/{id} only removes the Event when confirmation_code matches; otherwise it redirects back with a danger flash. The listing's Remove button now links to the confirmation page.
